# The Pico Mart. One room, one counter, one clerk.
#
# The shelves are fence tiles, which block, so the clerk at the gap between
# them is the only way through and the player cannot end up talking to a
# shopkeeper from behind.

zone picomart
name PICO MART
size 11 9
indoor

tiles
WWWWWWWWWWW
WfffffffffW
W====f====W
WfffffffffW
WfffffffffW
WfffffffffW
WfffffffffW
WfffffffffW
WWWWWdWWWWW
end

warp 5 8 hometown 5 17 south

npc clerk 5 3 south healer
  stock picoball, greatball, potion, antidote
  say Anything you can carry.
end

npc shopper 8 5 west villager
  say A GREAT BALL is worth three of the cheap ones.
  say Not really. It is worth about one and a half.
end

event sign 2 5
  say NO PICOMON OUT IN THE SHOP. THANK YOU.
end
